    "display_name": "Two Dice",
    "long_instructions": "## Two Dice\r\n\r\nModify the original program so it rolls two dice.\r\n\r\n1. Create a second variable to store another random roll.\r\n2. Print the first roll.\r\n3. Print the second roll.\r\n4. Add both rolls together and store the result in a total variable.\r\n5. Print the total.\r\n\r\n**Check:** Run the program several times. Do both rolls stay between 1 and 6?",
